.stryker-tmp/

# The generated site. It is a pure function of the history under raw/, so
# committing it stored the same facts twice and made every push collide on the
# regenerated pages. .github/workflows/pages.yml builds it at deploy time and
# uploads it as the Pages artifact instead.
build/

# The old output directory, kept here so a stale checkout or an older generator
# cannot quietly start committing build output back into the archive.
docs/site/
liveness-body.md
